Subject: [PATCH 10/10] hunt stress0: the reader of the failing traces, and the
 two-by-two of the scratch fixes against the forced schedules

analyze_traces.py reads the logs the loop keeps for failing runs and says, for
the scan that answered wrongly, how the reader's load of the position, the
publisher's swap of the slot it took, the take and the publisher's store of
the position were ordered; cross.sh runs each of the two forced schedules
against builds with neither, either or both of the scratch fixes.

